Subject: [PATCH] fix(ui): await sheet measurement without restarting entrance

Handle user feedback that filter panels no longer appear after preview.37/50. Share the fix with Mihon 0092. Await valid measured anchors inside a single opening coroutine instead of keying it on measurement readiness. The old launch may start after layout has already supplied a height, then get cancelled by its false-to-true readiness key change; its finally marks entry complete while the sheet is still hidden, allowing the hidden-position observer to immediately dismiss it. Keep deliberate dismissal and drag interruption behavior, scrim synchronization and existing distance/velocity policies. Add actual Android Dialog-window tests that open through a button, assert visible settled content and no spontaneous dismissal, close and reopen three times for phone and centered presentations. Increase only chapter/episode selection action-bar top padding by 4dp, retaining lower padding, compact controls and immediate response. Library selection-bar dimensions and glass/navigation behavior remain unchanged.
